            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for taking the time to share your feedback with us. We’re glad to hear that you enjoyed the home overall and truly appreciate your kind comments.\n\nWe understand your concerns regarding the kitchen and living room seating, especially for a larger family gathering. All photos on the listing are kept up to date so guests can clearly view the home’s layout and furnishings prior to booking, and we appreciate you sharing your experience. We will be sure to pass your feedback along to the owner for review and consideration.\n\nThank you again for staying with us. We truly value your input and would love the opportunity to welcome you back in the future.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
